<template><main class="likes-page"><header class="likes-header"><button @click="$router.back()"><van-icon name="arrow-left"/> <span>返回</span></button><div><p>LIKED ARTICLES</p><h1>我的点赞</h1></div><span class="count">{{ items.length }} 条</span></header><section class="likes-content"><div class="likes-hero"><p>YOUR APPRECIATIONS</p><strong>{{ items.length }}</strong><span> 条点赞记录</span><em>你点赞过的每一篇资讯，都会保存在这里。</em></div><div v-if="items.length" class="likes-list"><news-item v-for="(item,i) in items" :key="item.id" :news="item" :index="i"/></div><div v-else class="likes-empty"><van-icon name="good-job-o"/><h2>还没有点赞记录</h2><p>遇到值得关注的新闻，点个赞，它就会出现在这里。</p><button @click="$router.push('/home')">去点赞新闻</button></div></section></main></template>
